  "description": "Digital Nation-State 'Etzhayyim' — blockchain-registered sovereign territory operated by Stichting Etzhayyim (Netherlands religious corporation). Extends the etzhayyim-organism autopoietic artificial organization into a fully autonomous government, implementing all COFOG divisions as AI Agent performers on Kubernetes with blockchain-based land registry, identity, currency, and governance. Includes DoDAF v2 DM2 resource planning for AI-to-human hiring workflows managed in etzhayyim-project-har.",
